<title>UK: Tunisia buys cargo of white sugar for June -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys cargo of white sugar for June -trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought a cargo of white sugar for shipment in June 1997, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price paid was $354.50 per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>Details of the supplier have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>Tunisia bought two 14,000-tonne cargoes of whites on September 18 for May and July, at an undisclosed price. It bought a same-sized cargo the day before from a London-based trade house at $366 per tonne c &amp; f.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
